The abstract interpretation of the P2P peer ENR validation logic for BPO fork compatibility was performed across the following primary files:

- `/home/gohan/ga-runners/actions-runner-security-agent-1/_work/security-agent/security-agent/target_workspace/beacon-chain/p2p/fork.go` -- contains `compareForkENR`, `updateENR`, `forkEntry`, and `nfd` functions
